    "text": "Let G be a right-angled Artin group. Is the stable commutator length scl(g)\na rational number for every g ∈ [G, G]? For free groups this is true by Calegari’s\nRationality Theorem. (See 18.40 for the definition of scl(g).)            I. Soroko",
